A(("FIG", "1"))
A(("CAP", "**Figure 2. Mediation arm.** Paths *a*, *b* and *c* are estimated by least squares and combined by the product of coefficients, with bootstrap intervals, Benjamini–Hochberg correction and regression calibration for the estimated mediator. *Corrections applied in the text:* a lithium × ILR interaction test is added before any proportion mediated is reported (Section 4.5), since the product of coefficients is invalid under interaction; the note about running the analysis “a couple of different ways” is replaced by a single pre-specified primary model; and the circularity procedures of Section 4.6 are added. “Lineage balance tree” and “product of coefficients” are defined in Sections 4.4 and 4.5 respectively."))

A(("FIG", "2"))
A(("CAP", "**Figure 3. Prediction contest arm.** *Corrections applied in the text:* the single 10% test split is replaced by repeated nested cross-validation (Section 4.3), since roughly seven held-out non-users cannot support an equivalence claim; an **inner tuning loop** is required, because tuning within the evaluation folds shown here biases the estimate optimistically; a third feature set, expression residualised on the ILR coordinates, is added to separate prediction from mediation (Section 2.1); and the choice of elastic net and random forest is justified in Section 4.3."))

A(("FIG", "3"))
A(("CAP", "**Figure 4. Network analysis arm.** *Corrections applied in the text:* “500-100 draws” was a typo and the figure is 500 draws; a module stability gate is added before group comparison, since subsampling to 74 discards most controls (Section 4.7); preservation statistics are pooled across draws before Benjamini–Hochberg rather than after, because 500 resamples of the same data are not 500 independent tests; and the primary group contrast is specified as bipolar I on lithium versus bipolar I off lithium, the only pair that isolates medication from diagnosis."))

